  "result": "Perfect! All 236 tests pass \u2713\n\n**Added foreign currency support to src/money.js**\n\n**New constant:**\n- `RATES = { EUR: 1, USD: 1.085, GBP: 0.8425 }` \u2014 exchange rates (units of that currency per euro)\n\n**New functions:**\n- `convert(eurCents, currency)` \u2014 converts EUR cents to another currency\n  - Returns `ok(amount in target currency's cents)` or `fail('UNKNOWN_CURRENCY')`\n  - Formula: EUR cents \u00d7 rate \u2192 target currency cents\n  - Properly rounds using roundCents (banker's rounding)\n  - Handles zero and negative amounts\n\n- `formatMoney(cents, currency)` \u2014 formats amount in specified currency\n  - Similar to formatEuros but with appropriate symbols: \u20ac (EUR), $ (USD), \u00a3 (GBP)\n  - Maintains thousands separators and 2 decimal places\n  - Handles negative amounts with leading minus sign\n\n**Error handling:**\n- Added UNKNOWN_CURRENCY error code to src/errors.js\n\n**Tests added: 15 new tests covering**\n- RATES constant values\n- Converting EUR to USD, GBP, and EUR (1:1)\n- Unknown currency error handling\n- Zero and negative amount conversion\n- Large amount conversion\n- Rounding behavior\n- Formatting in EUR, USD, and GBP\n- Thousands separators in formatted output\n- Combined conversion and formatting (EUR invoice total to USD and GBP)",
